# BuildKit picks this file up for `docker build -f deploy/nas/rr-api/Dockerfile .` (context = repo root).
# The root .dockerignore is the legacy-builder fallback for both images, so it keeps public/ and
# src/ (the admin image copies them); everything else is the same. Keep the three in sync.
.git
.github
.claude
.wrangler
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.log
docs
plans
public
src
tests
tools
README.md
*.md
.local
.superdesign
